<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Tajpur Mau | Safe Shifting UP-54
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What measures does Shree Ashirwad take to ensure my bike arrives without scratches during transit from Tajpur Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike is loaded onto a hydraulic ramp trailer using padded steel cradles and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Our trained technicians perform a pre‑loading audit, then secure the bike within a sealed, climate‑controlled container. Real‑time GPS monitoring and a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by 100% insurance further protect your vehicle throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my bike via railway from Tajpur Mau, and how does the IRCTC integration work?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad coordinates with IRCTC to book a dedicated bike parcel on scheduled freight trains. After road pickup, the bike is transferred to a railway carriage equipped with anti‑vibration mounts. We handle all paperwork, including the e‑Way bill, and provide door‑to‑door tracking until the bike reaches the destination rail station.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is full insurance mandatory for bike transportation in Tajpur Mau, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full transit insurance is compulsory for all interstate and railway shipments. Our IRDAI‑approved policy covers declared value, accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities from the moment of pickup until delivery. Claims are processed within 48 hours, and the insurance cost is transparently included in the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the doorstep pickup service handle pre‑loading audits and documentation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our doorstep team arrives at the exact address—whether Tajpur Central, Sahadatpura, or Junction Colony—armed with a digital checklist. They verify bike condition, capture high‑resolution photos, and complete a pre‑loading audit on a tablet. All data, including the IRCTC or road‑freight manifest, is uploaded instantly to our cloud portal for customer access.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for a bike shipment from Tajpur Mau to major hubs like Delhi or Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies with the chosen mode. Pure road transport averages 14‑16 hours to Delhi and 20‑22 hours to Kolkata via the National Highway Arterial Corridors. When combined with railway legs, the total door‑to‑door time drops to 12‑14 hours for Delhi and 18‑20 hours for Kolkata, thanks to priority freight slots.</p>
      </div>
